~ start
Diwa: Woof? I swear I smell someone coming… 

Cat?: Meow? Is anyone here?

Diwa: Oh, hello! I’ve never seen you around here before, have I…?

Cat?: Ah, no no. Just passing by!

Diwa: Oh… Alright. I'm Diwa by the way!

Julia: The name's Julia. Pleasure.

Julia: Hmm, a dog taking care of a garden? That's unusual.

Julia: Oh! Is this that garden that was popular a couple months ago? My cat friends used to tell me about it.

Diwa: Ah, Really? We were that well known?

Julia: Mhm. Pawsitibly sure this is the spot.

Diwa: Well… Thanks for visiting!

Julia: Of course! 

Julia: By the way, I might drop by again later, if you don’t mind. 

Julia: It’s really nice to see this place still has someone taking care of it, after all.

Diwa: Sure thing. I definitely wouldn’t mind – and any company’s nice.

Julia: Okay then. See you around then, doggy. Good luck with work.

Diwa: See… you?

Diwa: …

Diwa: … Did they really just call me doggy and leave? I have a name you know! ^^;

=> END